            "value": "F Wrds n'utilise pas ces réglages Espanso, mais les conserve et les réécrit lors de l'export."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "F Wrds lives in the menu bar. Open its window from the icon to add and edit snippets.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
