    "F Wrds replaces short triggers with longer text as you type. Type a trigger in any app and it expands on the spot. For example, `;sig` can become your full email signature.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F Wrds replaces short triggers with longer text as you type. Type a trigger in any app and it expands on the spot. For example, `;sig` can become your full email signature."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F Wrds remplace de courts déclencheurs par un texte plus long pendant que vous écrivez. Saisissez un déclencheur dans n'importe quelle app et il se développe aussitôt. Par exemple, `;sig` peut devenir votre signature d'e-mail complète."
          }
        }
      }
    },
