    "If Espanso is still running, both apps react to the same trigger and the text comes out garbled. F Wrds warns you when it spots Espanso and offers to quit it.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Espanso is still running, both apps react to the same trigger and the text comes out garbled. F Wrds warns you when it spots Espanso and offers to quit it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si Espanso tourne encore, les deux apps réagissent au même déclencheur et le texte sort mélangé. F Wrds vous prévient quand il repère Espanso et propose de le quitter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If permissions are missing, choose **Help → Run Setup Again…**. An update can reset them.": {
